        "content": "<p>adamrk opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14637\">PR #14637</a> from <code>adamrk:abk/bforest-split-oom</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When we need to split nodes in a bforest to perform an insertion, allocate<br>\nthe worst case depth + 1 nodes all up front so that the insertion<br>\natomically completes or fails. Otherwise the bforest can drop nodes that <br>\nwere in the tree.</p>\n</blockquote>",
